01:11:09,473 --> 01:11:15,473
High Ground is a 2020 Australian film directed by Stephen Maxwell Johnson, based on historical events that
took place in Arnhem Land in the Northern Territory of Australia, set just after World War I.

14
01:16:37,894 --> 01:16:43,894
It has variously been called a revisionist Western and Australian Western.

15
01:22:06,315 --> 01:22:12,315
However, it tells of a true historical event in a fictionalised manner but
with very close attention to and respect for Aboriginal culture.

16
01:27:34,736 --> 01:27:40,736
The film premiered at the 70th Berlin International Film Festival on 23 February 2020,  with the Australian premiere at the
Brisbane International Film Festival later that year, and theatrical release in Australia on 28 January 2021.

